{"The new FEATURE_DISABLED constant is inconsistent with the existing *_EXIT_CODE naming convention (ROLLING_UPGRADE_EXIT_CODE, RECREATE_UPGRADE_EXIT_CODE), making it harder to recognize as an exit-code contract and easier to confuse with a boolean flag. Should be renamed to FEATURE_DISABLED_EXIT_CODE": 0.3083871006965637, "The feature-disabled error message doesn't tell the user how to resolve the problem. Should include the exact CLI option to enable it (e.g. 'Enable it with --features=rolling-updates') to make the failure actionable": 0.6124169826507568, "Grammar issue: 'While on preview stage' is unidiomatic English. Should be 'While in preview' or 'While in the preview stage'": 0.20191334187984467}